WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.118 --> 00:00:01.110
(dramatic music)

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.190
- The reason why I chose a
skull more than anything else

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.490
is because underneath
all our skin is a skull.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.893
It's the universal image to everybody.

00:00:12.881 --> 00:00:15.798
(speaking Spanish)

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:29.950
- My name is Butch Locsin,

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.730
I am a contemporary performance
artist here in Los Angeles.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:35.683
I wear a skull mask and I
play with smoke grenades.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.070
My work is reflective
of the Mexican culture

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.770
and iconography and artwork.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.950
Maria saw a lot of the
photos that I was doing

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.750
and she wanted to actually
collaborate on a project.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.520
And integrating her into what I do

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.350
has been really fun and successful.

00:00:53.646 --> 00:00:56.563
(speaking Spanish)

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.100
- Maria, to me, has been such a blessing

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.410
because now the character
and the skeleton and colors

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:23.710
actually marry to her.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:26.670
And we've been creating
love scenes and stories.

00:01:28.545 --> 00:01:31.462
(speaking Spanish)

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.970
- I really like the Day
of the Dead holiday.

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:43.080
It's not about celebrating
someone's death,

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.180
it's more about
celebrating someone's life.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.880
My artwork and my performance
is kind of little bit

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.070
of a reflection of that,

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.680
but even though I kind of represent myself

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.280
as like this Death character,

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.873
you know I'm very much alive.

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:02.032
(speaking Spanish)

00:02:12.204 --> 00:02:13.460
- What I love about performance art

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:15.040
is honestly the rush that I get

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.720
from working with so many people.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:18.870
You know it makes me want to go out there

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.595
and create some more and
do something different.

00:02:21.595 --> 00:02:24.595
(speaking Spanish)

